* {{sense|original}} {{l/pt|antigo}}, {{l/pt|antiquado}}, {{l/pt|ultrapassado}}, {{l/pt|vetusto}}
* {{sense|about to begin or recently begun}} {{l/pt|passado}}, {{l/pt|velho}}

===Noun===
